// qw_hud_holdables_strip — V2_HUD_Active holdable-items strip
// Interface: #include once into the HUD composer menuDef body.
// Source: docs/wui-claude-design-canonical-v2/project/qw-screens.jsx:1207-1237
//   (right:28 bottom:144; owned holdable icons; equipped slot emphasized).
//
// ABI (0 engine LoC): the EXISTING `holdablelist` hudElement (register
// cl_wired_ui_hud_register.c:163) self-draws owned holdables + selected-slot
// emphasis from wiredHud->holdableList[].selected via color2
// (cl_wired_hud_elem_holdablelist.c:67-69). Dynamic count (owned holdables
// only; at the arena1 fixed-viewpoint spawn the player owns 0 → empty render).
//
// Orientation finding: holdablelist is VERTICAL-ONLY (holdablelist.c:94 `y+=h`,
// no textAlign-CENTER horizontal branch like weaponlist). The mockup strip is
// horizontal; a horizontal branch (mirroring weaponlist's CENTER axis) is a
// deferred engine item. Harmless at the test spawn (0 holdables → nothing
// drawn), so authored via the existing element rather than HALT-forking a
// widget that renders empty here.
// Tokens: $bone (label) $hud_panel_bg (idle slot) $accent (equipped slot).
// HUD redesign (Eser) Phase D: holdables → RIGHT edge, vertical, ABOVE the
// powerup-timer stack (powerups sit ~y0.48-0.56 CENTER_RIGHT). Was bottom-right
// y0.80, which now collides with the dip ammo panel. Grouping holdables with the
// powerups makes the right edge the "active-status" column. rect FULL-VIEWPORT;
// holdablelist is vertical (holdablelist.c y+=h) so it stacks downward from here.
itemDef { hudElement "holdablelist"
	anchor CENTER_RIGHT
	rect 0.951 0.38 0.046 0.046
	font $font_sans
	fontsize 10 12
	forecolor $bone
	backcolor $hud_panel_bg
	color2 $accent
	decoration
	visible 1
}
